# Code Owners

This file defines individuals or teams that are responsible for code in specific
paths or files. Every code change must be reviewed by at least one owner of the
code being modified.

## Ownership Rules

Owners are responsible for:
- Reviewing and approving pull requests for their areas
- Maintaining code quality and security in their areas
- Triaging issues related to their areas
- Ensuring tests pass and coverage requirements are met

